# Purpose: confirm, from source rather than from the error string, that
# `request_plugin_install` can never install a plugin during `codex exec`.
# That is what makes provisioning before `codex exec` the only workable path
# and what justifies treating the rejection as a Hive Mind-side failure.

=== 1. The plugin id is compared by exact equality against a server-supplied list
=== codex-rs/core/src/tools/handlers/request_plugin_install.rs

